tests/golden/check/not-mutable.hero:16:5: error[no_mutable_globals]: `MAX` is a top-level declaration, and there are no mutable globals — pass what changes as an `@` parameter
tests/golden/check/not-mutable.hero:19:9: error[not_mutable]: `e` is the loop variable, and it is bound afresh for each element — write to a cell declared outside the loop
